<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Insult</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>insult &lt;character&gt;
</pre>
<p>Comes up with a fitting insult for the character you name. Beware, some might 
get angry!
</p><p>Insulting your own guild master is how you leave a guild: the guild master 
takes it very personally, and you are no longer a member. Think twice before 
you do it. To join a guild, see <a cmd='#'>Help Join</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Join</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Guilds</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Socials</a>
</pre>




</div>